{"title":"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0efa7d3018be32e8205fd7e026648697c423944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Least_common_multiple\" title=\"Least common multiple\">least common multiple</a> of the positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/f/7bf8cf167990d3d4a27df8cb8a70727fd8fb6067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^6$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b2f57e7da066c1ba029a35a6caeffe9cd980bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^8$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is evident that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> has only 2s and 3s in its prime factorization, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/b/08b852011e8490edc5f7572a868399f750720769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2^a3^b$\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/0919f72e92b0772b6cc0549d9b4dd1dfbb53380a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^6 = 2^6\\cdot3^6$\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0cd42466102ed9ec31cd07a7d6aa9a1612f0dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^8 = 2^{24}$\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa2e5459761aac9e32a00077137877b05a49e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^{12} = 2^{24}\\cdot3^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"15\" /></li></ul>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LCM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"LCM\">LCM</a> of any numbers an be found by writing out their factorizations and taking the greatest power for each factor. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a3784d45cf90b4f699775de824f0cb19215f08f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[6^6,8^8] = 2^{24}3^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"21\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a76da6ba7634a57a636d73a6428f2f9713b4c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^{12} = 2^{24}\\cdot3^{12} = [2^{24}3^6,2^a3^b] = 2^{\\max(24,a)}3^{\\max(6,b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"383\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a450ff18c9509e2f70ba9f036b8ca9aeb33d49c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0dabac835d73b5c844287dd767f4b1422a3cbfc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le a \\le 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d000f4c985761c51268403c667b77a77667f3339.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb6885007f0468960cd2ec927c32553c8ba79b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}(6^6,8^8,k)=12^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08b48f5c9d1ff05b5e78cf8050b0a6c7693e2c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> properties, this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76bb86d415d4d80248a0a3e88c9d824dc1da158b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}(\\operatorname{lcm}(2^6\\cdot 3^6,2^{24}),k)=2^{24} \\cdot 3^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"266\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d243f9d272207ace2c42528054226883b9433190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}(2^{24}\\cdot 3^6,k)=2^{24}\\cdot 3^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>At this point, we realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f2f690266fae464d8ad30b4034f131dda6f08e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2^a\\cdot3^b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />, as any other prime factors would be included in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08b48f5c9d1ff05b5e78cf8050b0a6c7693e2c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/90741700aba2f224c526ef49ea5bc9702df37896.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> (or the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08b48f5c9d1ff05b5e78cf8050b0a6c7693e2c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> wouldn't be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a656b3ceb45bdcd57d2837eeb485a34f68e3d65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le a\\le 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" /> (or the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08b48f5c9d1ff05b5e78cf8050b0a6c7693e2c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />).\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be any integer from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c4fe592e51f3609d9a26a1f6ec5e7d57aee090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=2899\">https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=2899</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME\" title=\"1998 AIME\">1998 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191128\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 272/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1737/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 96/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6895/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.292      1 -total\n 60.54%    8.652      1 Template:AIME_box\n 37.38%    5.343      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3022:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 2026101